Subject: [PATCH] Materialize parametrized test cases for pytest 9.1

Pytest 9.1 deprecates non-Collection iterables as parameter values.
Convert generators and itertools.product results to lists so collection
succeeds with deprecation warnings treated as errors. Generate protocol
cases in pytest_generate_tests, after all helper functions are defined.

Assisted-by: Codex:gpt-6-astra

